# Connect all three keys before pasting your brief. Ask your agent to create/open
# .env beside README.md, preserving existing values. Paste keys privately after =.
# Save as .env, not .env.txt. Never share keys in chat, logs or public files.
# Kie: sign in/up, then API Key Management > create/copy a key.
# https://kie.ai/api-key
# Bundled Kie photo/copy generation and API buyer review.
KIE_AI_API_KEY=your_key
# Apify: Settings > API & Integrations > Personal API tokens > + Create a new token.
# https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations
# Used for CLI --linkedin collection.
APIFY_API_KEY=your_token
# Firecrawl: sign in/up, then API Keys > create/copy a key.
# https://www.firecrawl.dev/app/api-keys
# Used for CLI --website scraping.
FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=your_key
# Provider usage may cost extra. Supplied assets and offline render need no calls.
